  "task.514D122185675E38.title": "Automatic: Controlled Fusion",
  "quest.514D113E1E8CF8B1.title": "Controlled Fusion",
  "quest.514D113E1E8CF8B1.quest_subtitle": "Stage 5 · Main route",
  "quest.514D113E1E8CF8B1.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Fusion Reactor Controller (mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_controller). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 16 × Fusion Reactor Frame (mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_frame). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Fusion Reactor Port (mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_port). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Laser Focus Matrix (mekanismgenerators:laser_focus_matrix). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Form and fuel the Fusion Reactor and prepare laser ignition. Fill a Hohlraum and start it using Mekanism's procedure. Open the formed controller and remain within 16 blocks for at least 10 seconds of actual fusion burn, positive power generation and energy in its internal buffer. Leaving or losing the formed reactor resets unfinished observation."
  ],
