  "chapter.513010AF0D36DCAD.title": "12 · Applied Energistics Networks",
  "chapter.513010AF0D36DCAD.chapter_subtitle": [
    "80 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Hexagon: route · square: development · circle: optional",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.513012EC9DAC9FB4.title": "Obtain 1 × Calculation Processor",
  "quest.513011E6243A5B01.title": "Calculation Processor for Precision",
  "quest.513011E6243A5B01.quest_subtitle": "Stage 1 · Main route",
  "quest.513011E6243A5B01.quest_desc": [
    "This is AE2’s first required contribution to shared industrial progression. Prepare an Inscriber, Calculation Press, Silicon Press and silicon; a large ME network is not needed yet.",
    "Print the Calculation Circuit and Printed Silicon, then combine them with redstone in the Inscriber. Finished processors are ingredients of the Precision Mechanism in chapter 00, Main Route.",
    "After precision production, return for network power, storage and basic autocrafting. The first processor is deliberately available before that milestone."
  ],
  "task.513012130F49DDD6.title": "Network Apprentice",
  "quest.513011AF7E8D7059.title": "Network Apprentice",
  "quest.513011AF7E8D7059.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Practice",
  "quest.513011AF7E8D7059.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement Network Apprentice (ae2:main/network1). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.51301211DFAE50E4.title": "Trade with an AE2 Toolsmith",
  "quest.513011076371E83C.title": "Trade with an AE2 Toolsmith",
  "quest.513011076371E83C.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Practice",
  "quest.513011076371E83C.quest_desc": [
    "Complete a real trade with the AE2 Better Villagers Toolsmith profession. Assign its correct workstation first; this check distinguishes the actual profession."
  ],
  "task.5130125F0053B3EB.title": "Obtain 1 × Guide",
  "quest.5130112BC0CDCCBA.title": "AE2: Your First Network Route",
  "quest.5130112BC0CDCCBA.quest_subtitle": "Stage 1 · Mod development",
  "quest.5130112BC0CDCCBA.quest_desc": [
    "Workshop order: quartz and presses, then an Inscriber, Calculation Processor and Precision Mechanism. Next connect an Energy Acceptor, storage and a terminal.",
    "With standard channels, a small network without a Controller supports up to eight channel-using devices. Basic autocrafting needs a CPU containing 1k Crafting Storage, a Pattern Provider and a Molecular Assembler.",
    "Controllers, larger storage components and remote networks belong to later milestones. The built-in Guide provides device diagrams; JEI shows this pack’s modified recipes."
  ],
