  "task.513012EB5434F4AA.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Controller (Basic)",
  "quest.513011AB19DDDE4C.title": "Basic Reactor after Lunar Materials",
  "quest.513011AB19DDDE4C.quest_subtitle": "Stage 4 · Mod development",
  "quest.513011AB19DDDE4C.quest_desc": [
    "The Basic Extreme Reactor controller requires Dimensional Matrix, Quantum Processor and Radiation Shield. The shield needs Desh plates, placing a working reactor after the first Moon trip.",
    "Build a closed casing with the required fuel and control rods, a fuel port and an energy output using the Extreme Reactors diagram. Open the controller and verify that the multiblock has formed.",
    "Begin with a small fuel reserve and test energy and waste handling. This branch supplies electricity; Mekanism’s nuclear progression products come from a separate system."
  ],
