  "task.51301262D9124DDE.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Controller (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011FE8D522CBB.title": "Reinforced Reactor for the Load",
  "quest.513011FE8D522CBB.quest_subtitle": "Stage 4 · Mod development",
  "quest.513011FE8D522CBB.quest_desc": [
    "The reinforced controller adds Stellar Alloy to radiation shielding and quantum electronics. Use compatible-tier parts throughout the structure.",
    "Choose the output first: direct electricity or heated fluid for a turbine. The latter needs a complete coolant and return circuit, not just a larger casing.",
    "Check formation, fuel flow and the consumer at a small operating rate. Owning the controller for its quest does not verify a working multiblock."
  ],
