  "chapter.513010FECF12A7FD.title": "00 · Main Route",
  "chapter.513010FECF12A7FD.chapter_subtitle": [
    "22 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Hexagon: route · square: development · circle: optional",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.5130125C7CB17322.title": "Obtain 1 × Industrial Chassis",
  "quest.513011E734464E5D.title": "Industrial Chassis",
  "quest.513011E734464E5D.quest_subtitle": "Stage 1 · Main route",
  "quest.513011E734464E5D.quest_desc": [
    "The first material milestone opens basic industry. Start in chapter 03: produce steel, treated wood and an Immersive Engineering Iron Mechanical Component.",
    "One recipe yields 2 chassis from 4 steel plates, 2 treated planks, 2 copper wire coils and 1 iron component. Hold the completed chassis before spending it on machines.",
    "Next comes Precision Mechanism. Establish Mekanism and Ender IO alloys, then use chapter 12 to prepare quartz, presses and an Inscriber for processors. That quartz preparation is already available after the chassis.",
    "Nearby projects show applications of this stage. Completing every item in the mod catalogues is not a prerequisite for the next material milestone."
  ],
  "task.513012E390D60729.title": "Obtain 8 × Steel Plate",
  "task.513012B62DDD0E16.title": "Obtain 4 × Iron Gear",
  "task.513012623A6CE94E.title": "Obtain 1 × Industrial Chassis",
  "quest.5130112A4F09A072.title": "Obtain 8 × Steel Plate + Obtain 4 × Iron Gear + More",
  "quest.5130112A4F09A072.quest_subtitle": "Stage 1 · Mod development",
  "quest.5130112A4F09A072.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 8 × Steel Plate (immersiveengineering:plate_steel). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Iron Gear (buildcraftcore:gears/gear_iron). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Industrial Chassis (kubejs:industrial_chassis). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301222A7B71AFD.title": "Obtain 2 × Oak Full Drawers 1",
  "task.513012BD7C2EBB63.title": "Obtain 8 × Conveyor Belt",
  "task.51301202E2176A48.title": "Obtain 8 × Iron Pipe",
  "quest.513011B48AB5BC29.title": "Obtain 2 × Oak Full Drawers 1 + Obtain 8 × Conveyor Belt + More",
  "quest.513011B48AB5BC29.quest_subtitle": "Stage 1 · Mod development",
  "quest.513011B48AB5BC29.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 2 × Oak Full Drawers 1 (storagedrawers:oak_full_drawers_1). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 8 × Conveyor Belt (immersiveengineering:conveyor_basic). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 8 × Iron Pipe (classicpipes:iron_pipe). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012B16F221ACE.title": "Obtain 1 × Precision Mechanism",
  "quest.5130115E1ED084F6.title": "Precision Mechanism",
  "quest.5130115E1ED084F6.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Main route",
  "quest.5130115E1ED084F6.quest_desc": [
    "The second milestone combines metallurgy and processors. Its quest prerequisites include the chassis, steel plate, Mekanism alloys and an AE2 Calculation Processor.",
    "One batch yields 2 mechanisms from 2 Redstone Alloy, 2 Calculation Processor, 2 Infused Alloy, 1 Industrial Chassis and 2 Electromechanical Drive. Test each production line before assembling the batch.",
    "A compact ME network and first autocrafting setup are now available: a Pattern Provider, Molecular Assembler and a CPU with 1k Crafting Storage. A plain Crafting Unit is not a working CPU by itself. Components of 4k and above remain behind Dimensional Matrix.",
    "Next prepare Dimensional Matrix: workshop-made Vibrant Alloy and Terrasteel, Enchanted Gravitite from Aether and Fiery Ingot from Twilight Forest. These supplies can be developed in parallel."
  ],
  "task.513012891C381350.title": "Obtain 4 × Steel Mechanical Component",
  "task.513012D6492F72E6.title": "Obtain 8 × Infused Alloy",
  "task.513012965AE6A0F1.title": "Obtain 4 × Calculation Processor",
  "task.5130129063A43DD6.title": "Obtain 1 × Precision Mechanism",
  "quest.513011D3D4BFF23C.title": "Obtain 4 × Steel Mechanical Component + Obtain 8 × Infused Alloy + More",
  "quest.513011D3D4BFF23C.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Mod development",
  "quest.513011D3D4BFF23C.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Steel Mechanical Component (immersiveengineering:component_steel). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 8 × Infused Alloy (mekanism:alloy_infused). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Calculation Processor (ae2:calculation_processor). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Precision Mechanism (kubejs:precision_mechanism). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012003DA61113.title": "Obtain 1 × Runic Altar",
  "task.5130124FC89943E7.title": "Obtain 1 × Rune of Mana",
  "task.5130124F8C3F34A5.title": "Obtain 2 × Advanced Control Circuit",
  "quest.5130115ACF38B6C1.title": "Obtain 1 × Runic Altar + Obtain 1 × Rune of Mana + More",
  "quest.5130115ACF38B6C1.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Mod development",
  "quest.5130115ACF38B6C1.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Runic Altar (botania:runic_altar). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Rune of Mana (botania:rune_mana). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 2 × Advanced Control Circuit (mekanism:advanced_control_circuit). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130124DF0945797.title": "Obtain 1 × Dimensional Matrix",
  "quest.513011AA869D0649.title": "Dimensional Matrix",
  "quest.513011AA869D0649.quest_subtitle": "Stage 3 · Main route",
  "quest.513011AA869D0649.quest_desc": [
    "The third milestone joins Ender IO, Botania, Aether and Twilight Forest. Its quest prerequisites lead to specific materials from those branches alongside Precision Mechanism.",
    "Two matrices require 2 Vibrant Alloy, 2 Terrasteel Ingot, 2 Precision Mechanism, 1 Enchanted Gravitite and 2 Fiery Ingot. This quest does not require every Aether dungeon or every item in the forest catalogue.",
    "The matrix opens larger AE2 components and space preparation. Before the first flight, build and fuel a rocket, prepare a complete spacesuit, oxygen and a return plan. Detecting the spacesuit item does not verify its oxygen reserve.",
    "Next prepare Stellar Alloy: lunar Desh, DivineRPG Eden Chunk and a Mekanism Elite Control Circuit."
  ],
  "task.5130120D5F8A1F63.title": "Obtain 2 × Terrasteel Ingot",
  "task.5130129400FE98AF.title": "Obtain 1 × Enchanted Gravitite",
  "task.513012A500E562D5.title": "Obtain 2 × Fiery Ingot",
  "quest.513011A9B3660665.title": "Obtain 2 × Terrasteel Ingot + Obtain 1 × Enchanted Gravitite + More",
  "quest.513011A9B3660665.quest_subtitle": "Stage 3 · Mod development",
  "quest.513011A9B3660665.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 2 × Terrasteel Ingot (botania:terrasteel_ingot). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Enchanted Gravitite (aether:enchanted_gravitite). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 2 × Fiery Ingot (twilightforest:fiery_ingot). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012E72F45E64C.title": "Obtain 1 × Crafting Unit",
  "task.513012E489E75B59.title": "Obtain 1 × Molecular Assembler",
  "task.513012C74478BFFA.title": "Obtain 1 × ME Pattern Provider",
  "task.5130125800F774AE.title": "Obtain 1 × Metallurgic Infuser",
  "quest.51301130F8B93E94.title": "ME Workshop Components",
  "quest.51301130F8B93E94.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Main route",
  "quest.51301130F8B93E94.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare the listed blocks for autocrafting and external processing. The tasks detect inventory components; completion does not prove the system is built or running.",
    "For a test bench, add 1k Crafting Storage, power, storage and a terminal. Put the Provider beside the Assembler, encode a plank recipe and request a small batch.",
    "Then configure a separate Processing Pattern for the Infuser: item input, the correct infusion material and product return. Check completion in the CPU’s job status."
  ],
  "task.513012FEB5651818.title": "Obtain 1 × Ender Chest",
  "task.5130120B4FD90E45.title": "Obtain 1 × Ender Tank",
  "task.513012D99DF3A4F4.title": "Obtain 1 × Matter Transmitter",
  "task.51301273FEBC64B5.title": "Obtain 1 × Matter Receiver",
