    "Have in your inventory 2 × Eden Chunk (divinerpg:eden_chunk). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Elite Control Circuit (mekanism:elite_control_circuit). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Stellar Alloy (kubejs:stellar_alloy). The items are not consumed by this task."
