  "task.51401288E593517B.title": "Obtain 1 × Golden Furnace",
  "quest.514011DDB6B69693.title": "Golden Furnace after Precision",
  "quest.514011DDB6B69693.quest_subtitle": "Stage 2 · Mod development",
  "quest.514011DDB6B69693.quest_desc": [
    "This pack’s Golden Furnace requires control electronics, Precision Mechanism and Industrial Chassis. It belongs to the second production stage even if gold is available earlier.",
    "Upgrade a compatible earlier furnace using the recipe and test a small batch. Augments serve different purposes; first choose speed, fuel efficiency or the required processing mode."
  ],
  "task.514012E70EFED368.title": "Obtain 1 × Diamond Furnace",
  "quest.514011AAAA9555C0.title": "Diamond Furnace after the Matrix",
  "quest.514011AAAA9555C0.quest_subtitle": "Stage 3 · Mod development",
  "quest.514011AAAA9555C0.quest_desc": [
    "The Diamond Furnace requires Quantum Processor and Dimensional Matrix in addition to the previous furnace and Precision Mechanism. This ladder resumes after the shared dimension materials.",
    "Emerald and Crystal continue within that stage; Netherite needs lunar materials and Stellar Alloy. Choose furnace capacity for your actual throughput rather than its casing color."
  ],
